# Tabs - zapzap (actions/zapzap/zapzap_tabs.kbd)
**tabs + l**        -- Tabs Next (C-A-tab)
**tabs + h**        -- Tabs Prev (C-A-S-tab)
**tabs + t**        -- Tab New (C-t)
**tabs + w**        -- Tab Close (C-w)
**tabs + lsft + t** -- Tab Undo Close (C-S-t)
**tabs + 1**        -- Tabs Goto 1 (C-A-/ [down] [ent])
**tabs + 2**        -- Tabs Goto 2 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 3**        -- Tabs Goto 3 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 4**        -- Tabs Goto 4 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 5**        -- Tabs Goto 5 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 6**        -- Tabs Goto 6 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 7**        -- Tabs Goto 7 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 8**        -- Tabs Goto 8 (C-A-/ [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [down] [ent])
**tabs + 9**        -- Tab Goto Last (C-9)
